{
  "name": "m-doss",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts",
  "totalSeconds": 57.746,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "01",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "This soldier refused to carry a gun, and America gave him its highest medal.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-doss/01.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.995,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "91bbf4ab4589"
    },
    {
      "id": "02",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "In 1942, he was offered a way out of the draft.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-doss/02.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.529,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "3fa07e674d9f"
    },
    {
      "id": "03",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "He said no.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-doss/03.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.042,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "3fa07e674d9f"
    },
    {
      "id": "04",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.2,
      "text": "But his faith said he must never kill.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-doss/04.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.849,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "3fa07e674d9f"
    },
    {
      "id": "05",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "So he went to war with no rifle, only a medic's bag.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-doss/05.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.484,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "3fa07e674d9f"
    },
    {
      "id": "06",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "On Guam and in the Philippines, he ran to the wounded under fire, again and again.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-doss/06.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.137,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "c41f1e19ba6a"
    },
    {
      "id": "07",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "So the army gave him two Bronze Stars.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-doss/07.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.79,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "c41f1e19ba6a"
    },
    {
      "id": "08",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Then came Okinawa.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-doss/08.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.184,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "e744cc91d0f2"
    },
    {
      "id": "09",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "His unit climbed a cliff the soldiers called Hacksaw Ridge.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-doss/09.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.126,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "e744cc91d0f2"
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "It was four hundred feet high.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-doss/10.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.196,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "e744cc91d0f2"
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "But Japanese troops hit back hard.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-doss/11.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.325,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "e744cc91d0f2"
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.2,
      "text": "About seventy-five men went down, and the rest pulled back.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-doss/12.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.052,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "e744cc91d0f2"
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.4,
      "text": "He stayed.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-doss/13.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.117,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "e744cc91d0f2"
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "One by one, he dragged the wounded to the edge, and lowered them down on a rope.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-doss/14.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.733,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "e744cc91d0f2"
    },
    {
      "id": "15",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Weeks later, a grenade tore into his legs.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-doss/15.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.379,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "55e66b146f82"
    },
    {
      "id": "16",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "On the stretcher, he saw another wounded man.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-doss/16.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.851,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "55e66b146f82"
    },
    {
      "id": "17",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "So he crawled off and gave him his place.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-doss/17.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.139,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "55e66b146f82"
    },
    {
      "id": "18",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Then he was hit again, and his arm broke.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-doss/18.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.025,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "55e66b146f82"
    },
    {
      "id": "19",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "He crawled three hundred yards to get help.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-doss/19.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.955,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "55e66b146f82"
    },
    {
      "id": "20",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "So did the army ever make him carry a gun?",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-doss/20.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.251,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "012d454d3679"
    },
    {
      "id": "21",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "No.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-doss/21.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.357,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "012d454d3679"
    },
    {
      "id": "22",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "That October, President Truman put the Medal of Honor around his neck.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-doss/22.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.518,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "012d454d3679"
    },
    {
      "id": "23",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "He was the first conscientious objector ever to receive it.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-doss/23.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.824,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "012d454d3679"
    },
    {
      "id": "24",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "The man who never fired a shot brought back about seventy-five.",
      "voice": "Puck",
      "src": "voiceover/m-doss/24.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.888,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "606c7f8d5577"
    }
  ]
}
